  <item>
    <title>Vol.05新手避坑指南：肥料应该怎么选</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67639ec51e823e72d30aa096</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67639ec51e823e72d30aa096</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 20 Dec 2024 09:47:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>想要植物开花结果</span><br><span>又担心肥料味儿大招虫</span><br><span>有机肥、无机肥</span><br><span>复合肥、缓释肥</span><br><span>怎么选适合植物的肥料</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5Dog3h_g_tdZnLtxsdw4S9I5yz.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>「还好有植物」新手避坑指南</span><br><span>本期主题：肥料应该怎么选</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpuOCkVECvWzpBenZfB6sQbY65oh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>在上期节目中，我们一起了解了植物生长所需的三种主要元素，以及“什么是有机肥、什么是无机肥”。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>（</span></strong></em><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151501&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=af568afcb681ca21ad0bd6dc677ba181&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151501&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=af568afcb681ca21ad0bd6dc677ba181&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><em><strong><span>错过上期节目的朋友，可以戳这里跳转回去</span></strong></em></a><em><strong><span>）</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span>本期节目将重点介绍“有机肥”和“无机肥（化肥）”各自的优缺点，以及我在日常种植中总结的一些施肥技巧与心得，希望能为各位新手花友在挑选肥料时提供一些参考。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bmraVBw0XsEfXo8O6Pp0og?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bmraVBw0XsEfXo8O6Pp0og?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN"><strong><span>本期节目「详细图文笔记」已同步更新至微信公众号（biechu100），可戳此处查看。</span></strong></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqRAkvtUcQrCMqwmZmP2o95r8kfb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> 有机肥的优缺点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">04:57</a> 无机肥（化肥）的优缺点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="531">08:51</a> 个人经验分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="702">11:42</a> 节目之外的碎碎念</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmM0FKccaXNBYyhV1RChc2hHeArb.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bmraVBw0XsEfXo8O6Pp0og?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bmraVBw0XsEfXo8O6Pp0og?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN"><strong><span>本期节目「详细图文笔记」已同步更新至微信公众号（biechu100），可戳此处查看。</span></strong></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkJ2nwsPNKthD5d3oyzZMAd-aFd8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>关于“养花种草”这件事，你还有哪些感兴趣的内容，或是在园艺种植过程中，遇到过哪些问题，都欢迎在评论区留言。虽然我不一定都能解答，但是我非常愿意和你一起去探索每个问题背后的答案。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmSey-YiJ94VBM4EoEh3ZLtCCsQn.jpg"></figure><span></span><h2><span>错过往期精彩内容？搭乘「植物时光机」回去看看</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi7m3YOIJYhlhZNUHA6CMuo0lobk.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151412&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=c250e9eb39662c68f8f6920dd9fcfb84&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151412&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=c250e9eb39662c68f8f6920dd9fcfb84&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><strong><span>Vol.01为什么要养花种草</span></strong></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flbmy2xdC32DyVRnhGZiPNQ1K_B9.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151422&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5ec368c6a95cccce033a5594484f9346&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151422&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5ec368c6a95cccce033a5594484f9346&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><strong><span>Vol.02新手花友的第一盆绿植推荐</span></strong></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmbgeoorE8r0frAGvY6SFl0xv-sg.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151466&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2ace55926df1c606a4d4af7354aa7011&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151466&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2ace55926df1c606a4d4af7354aa7011&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><strong><span>Vol.03新手避坑指南：浇水，能有多难！</span></strong></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoDQUhgSBVjnk9hXJ7WmLIF5SOtx.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151501&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=af568afcb681ca21ad0bd6dc677ba181&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151501&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=af568afcb681ca21ad0bd6dc677ba181&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><strong><span>Vol.04新手避坑指南：施肥，是必选项吗</span></strong></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmM0FKccaXNBYyhV1RChc2hHeArb.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bmraVBw0XsEfXo8O6Pp0og?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bmraVBw0XsEfXo8O6Pp0og?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN"><strong><span>Vol.05新手避坑指南：肥料应该怎么选</span></strong></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5Dog3h_g_tdZnLtxsdw4S9I5yz.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lj_sCEbyWuZFEe0e9l6FGHf5__lz.m4a" length="27702001" type="audio/mp4"/>
