  <item>
    <title>Vol.04新手避坑指南：施肥，是必选项吗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66baf84fdb5e6d6bf9ea60a3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66baf84fdb5e6d6bf9ea60a3</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Aug 2024 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>养花种草，一定要施肥吗？</span><br><span>五花八门的肥料都有什么区别？</span><br><span>果皮菜叶鸡蛋壳，到底能不能做肥料？</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5Dog3h_g_tdZnLtxsdw4S9I5yz.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>「还好有植物」新手避坑指</span><br><span>本期主题：施肥，是必选项吗</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrAV388eMX5-Bxrd3FAgtGscY1ki.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>关于“要不要给植物施肥”的问题，很多花友持有不同的态度。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有花友觉得：肥料就是植物最主要的营养来源，可以促使植物健康生长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也有花友认为：很多肥料都是化学物质兑出来的，无论是对植物还是对人，多多少少都会造成一定的伤害；如果是用动物粪便做肥料的话，又担心味儿太大，所以不喜欢使用“肥料”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么，“施肥”究竟是不是必选项呢？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/be_Q_lSi08dD3J3NSGmfbA?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/be_Q_lSi08dD3J3NSGmfbA?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN"><strong><span>本期节目「详细图文笔记」已同步更新至微信公众号（biechu100），可戳此处查看。</span></strong></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqRAkvtUcQrCMqwmZmP2o95r8kfb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> 话题介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">02:33</a> 要不要给植物施肥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">04:52</a> 园艺种植中最常见的三个化学元素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a> 氮元素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="402">06:42</a> 磷元素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">07:02</a> 钾元素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">07:42</a> 其他元素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="506">08:26</a> 肥料的分类</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="532">08:52</a> 有机肥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="557">09:17</a> 无机肥（化肥）</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/be_Q_lSi08dD3J3NSGmfbA?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/be_Q_lSi08dD3J3NSGmfbA?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN"><strong><span>本期节目「详细图文笔记」已同步更新至微信公众号（biechu100），可戳此处查看。</span></strong></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkJ2nwsPNKthD5d3oyzZMAd-aFd8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>关于“养花种草”这件事，你还有哪些感兴趣的内容，或是在园艺种植过程中，遇到过哪些问题，都欢迎在评论区留言。虽然我不一定都能解答，但是我非常愿意和你一起去探索每个问题背后的答案。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmSey-YiJ94VBM4EoEh3ZLtCCsQn.jpg"></figure><span></span><h2><span>错过往期精彩内容？搭乘「植物时光机」回去看看</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi7m3YOIJYhlhZNUHA6CMuo0lobk.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151412&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=c250e9eb39662c68f8f6920dd9fcfb84&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151412&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=c250e9eb39662c68f8f6920dd9fcfb84&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>Vol.01为什么要养花种草</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flbmy2xdC32DyVRnhGZiPNQ1K_B9.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151422&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5ec368c6a95cccce033a5594484f9346&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151422&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5ec368c6a95cccce033a5594484f9346&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>Vol.02新手花友的第一盆绿植推荐</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmbgeoorE8r0frAGvY6SFl0xv-sg.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151466&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2ace55926df1c606a4d4af7354aa7011&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151466&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2ace55926df1c606a4d4af7354aa7011&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>Vol.03新手避坑指南：浇水，能有多难！</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoDQUhgSBVjnk9hXJ7WmLIF5SOtx.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151501&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=af568afcb681ca21ad0bd6dc677ba181&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151501&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=af568afcb681ca21ad0bd6dc677ba181&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>Vol.04新手避坑指南：施肥，是必选项吗</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5Dog3h_g_tdZnLtxsdw4S9I5yz.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnMArwrFNsF7cUjY_NSJVhuN5llp.m4a" length="21387923" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:11:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkPPFhZ8_v-f3TAgxO9wGNWgC3n7.png"/>
