  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.03新手避坑指南：浇水？能有多难！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6424154373768bea35ba3b7b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6424154373768bea35ba3b7b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 29 Mar 2023 10:38:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>你知道吗？</span><br><span>你的勤劳灌溉、你精致的花盆、甚至是商家大大方方送给你的赠品……</span><br><span>都有可能是你养不活绿植的真正原因！</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5Dog3h_g_tdZnLtxsdw4S9I5yz.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>「还好有植物」新手避坑指南</span><br><span>本期主题：浇水？能有多难！</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtEFDCE-eK70mYQjCaJKOuZeN13A.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>在养花种草的过程中，相信很多花友都曾走过一些弯路、踩过一些坑，轻的可能交了一些学费，重的可能直接把自己心爱的植物给送走了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>分析这背后的原因，一方面可能是因为我们对植物的生长习性不熟悉造成的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然，也有可能是因为一些“误区”所造成的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，我想通过“新手避坑指南”这个系列，和各位新手花友分享一些，我自己和其他花友们走过的弯路、踩过的坑，为各位新手花友们提供一些有用的信息。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感兴趣的朋友同样一定要认真做好笔记咯。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/IAQLoXdQ51eIPay6hS4JfQ?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/IAQLoXdQ51eIPay6hS4JfQ?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN"><strong><span>本期节目「详细图文笔记」已同步更新至微信公众号（biechu100），可戳此处查看。</span></strong></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqRAkvtUcQrCMqwmZmP2o95r8kfb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 新手避坑指南来啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a> 浇水的误区与技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> 浇水也会把植物浇死</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> 常见的浇水误区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="319">05:19</a> 见干见湿浇水法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a> 买花盆也有坑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> 浇水的时间也有讲究</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="633">10:33</a> 结束</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/IAQLoXdQ51eIPay6hS4JfQ?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/IAQLoXdQ51eIPay6hS4JfQ?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN"><strong><span>本期节目「详细图文笔记」已同步更新至微信公众号（biechu100），可戳此处查看。</span></strong></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkJ2nwsPNKthD5d3oyzZMAd-aFd8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>关于“养花种草”这件事，你还有哪些感兴趣的内容，或是在园艺种植过程中，遇到过哪些问题，都欢迎在评论区留言。虽然我不一定都能解答，但是我非常愿意和你一起去探索每个问题背后的答案。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmSey-YiJ94VBM4EoEh3ZLtCCsQn.jpg"></figure><span></span><h2><span>错过往期精彩内容？搭乘「植物时光机」回去看看</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi7m3YOIJYhlhZNUHA6CMuo0lobk.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151412&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=c250e9eb39662c68f8f6920dd9fcfb84&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151412&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=c250e9eb39662c68f8f6920dd9fcfb84&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>Vol.01为什么要养花种草</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flbmy2xdC32DyVRnhGZiPNQ1K_B9.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151422&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5ec368c6a95cccce033a5594484f9346&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151422&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5ec368c6a95cccce033a5594484f9346&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>Vol.02新手花友的第一盆绿植推荐</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmbgeoorE8r0frAGvY6SFl0xv-sg.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151466&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2ace55926df1c606a4d4af7354aa7011&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151466&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2ace55926df1c606a4d4af7354aa7011&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>Vol.03新手避坑指南：浇水，能有多难！</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoDQUhgSBVjnk9hXJ7WmLIF5SOtx.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151501&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=af568afcb681ca21ad0bd6dc677ba181&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151501&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=af568afcb681ca21ad0bd6dc677ba181&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>Vol.04新手避坑指南：施肥，是必选项吗</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5Dog3h_g_tdZnLtxsdw4S9I5yz.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrE6FaqPfJUOYuIiXLlS0slctvvA.m4a" length="23496086" type="audio/mp4"/>
