  <item>
    <title>Vol.02新手花友的第一盆绿植推荐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/640fecdd092eb63cb08fa1f9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">640fecdd092eb63cb08fa1f9</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Mar 2023 03:41:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>无论你之前有没有养过绿植，也不管你之前养挂过多少植物。</span><br><span>从今天开始，从生长习性开始，重新去了解一株绿植，并试着和它相处吧。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5Dog3h_g_tdZnLtxsdw4S9I5yz.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>「还好有植物」</span><br><span>本期主题：新手花友的第一盆绿植推荐</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhGX122MnTReqNTfk2GQm88Yh95p.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>常听身边的朋友抱怨说：自己就是个植物杀手，再好养的植物，在他手上都活不过半年，短的活不过甚至半个月。</span><br><span>其实每种植物都有不同的生长习性，如果你不了解这些特性的话，用错了方法，照顾得越细心，越有可能把它送走。</span><br><span>本期节目，我挑选了一些我个人觉得比较适合新手花友练手的植物，同时也整理了一些花友们推荐的植物供大家参考，有需要的朋友可要认真做好笔记咯。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/u7cDRCPIaWy0qMr8Gyo9JQ?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/u7cDRCPIaWy0qMr8Gyo9JQ?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN"><span>本期节目「详细图文笔记」已同步更新至微信公众号（biechu100），可戳此处查看。</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqRAkvtUcQrCMqwmZmP2o95r8kfb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> “我就是个植物杀手！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> 主播分享自己种植过的植物品种</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 热心花友推荐新手种植的绿植</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">13:49</a> 种植感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="874">14:34</a> 结束语</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/u7cDRCPIaWy0qMr8Gyo9JQ?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/u7cDRCPIaWy0qMr8Gyo9JQ?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN"><span>本期节目「详细图文笔记」已同步更新至微信公众号（biechu100），可戳此处查看。</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmSey-YiJ94VBM4EoEh3ZLtCCsQn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>错过往期精彩内容？搭乘「植物时光机」回去看看</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi7m3YOIJYhlhZNUHA6CMuo0lobk.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151412&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=c250e9eb39662c68f8f6920dd9fcfb84&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151412&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=c250e9eb39662c68f8f6920dd9fcfb84&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>Vol.01为什么要养花种草</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flbmy2xdC32DyVRnhGZiPNQ1K_B9.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151422&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5ec368c6a95cccce033a5594484f9346&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151422&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5ec368c6a95cccce033a5594484f9346&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>Vol.02新手花友的第一盆绿植推荐</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmbgeoorE8r0frAGvY6SFl0xv-sg.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151466&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2ace55926df1c606a4d4af7354aa7011&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151466&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2ace55926df1c606a4d4af7354aa7011&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>Vol.03新手避坑指南：浇水，能有多难！</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5Dog3h_g_tdZnLtxsdw4S9I5yz.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
