  <item>
    <title>Vol.01用一株绿植与生活和解</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63f87f8ba42b41bccb6dade6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63f87f8ba42b41bccb6dade6</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 Feb 2023 09:12:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>生活里的你如果和我一样，没做过什么了不起的事，甚至…常常会陷入自我怀疑，我是不是什么都做不好？</span><br><span>那不如，养一盆绿植吧。</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5Dog3h_g_tdZnLtxsdw4S9I5yz.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>「还好有植物」</span><br><span>本期主题：你为什么想养花种草？</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhEtxYAiJSiz3V9Trt3qzwIWiLuW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>「还好有植物」是一档园艺类播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我希望在这档播客里，可以和更多喜欢养花种草的朋友一起去探索园艺种植的乐趣与技巧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论你是绿植杀手、新手小白，还是资深花友、专业园丁，都希望这档播客可以成为我们相互交流的平台。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/SgTRbr5BkuJxT7g6IH8arQ?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/SgTRbr5BkuJxT7g6IH8arQ?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN"><strong><span>本期节目「详细图文笔记」已同步更新至微信公众号（biechu100），可戳此处查看。</span></strong></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqRAkvtUcQrCMqwmZmP2o95r8kfb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 「还好有植物」自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 花友分享养花种草的理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a> 主播分享制作节目的初衷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">06:53</a> 下期主题预告</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/SgTRbr5BkuJxT7g6IH8arQ?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/SgTRbr5BkuJxT7g6IH8arQ?token=1950635382&amp;lang=zh_CN"><strong><span>本期节目「详细图文笔记」已同步更新至微信公众号（biechu100），可戳此处查看。</span></strong></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkJ2nwsPNKthD5d3oyzZMAd-aFd8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>关于“养花种草”这件事，你还有哪些感兴趣的内容，或是在园艺种植过程中，遇到过哪些问题，都欢迎在评论区留言。虽然我不一定都能解答，但是我非常愿意和你一起去探索每个问题背后的答案。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmSey-YiJ94VBM4EoEh3ZLtCCsQn.jpg"></figure><span></span><h2><span>错过往期精彩内容？搭乘「植物时光机」回去看看</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi7m3YOIJYhlhZNUHA6CMuo0lobk.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151412&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=c250e9eb39662c68f8f6920dd9fcfb84&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151412&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=c250e9eb39662c68f8f6920dd9fcfb84&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>Vol.01为什么要养花种草</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flbmy2xdC32DyVRnhGZiPNQ1K_B9.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151422&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5ec368c6a95cccce033a5594484f9346&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151422&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5ec368c6a95cccce033a5594484f9346&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>Vol.02新手花友的第一盆绿植推荐</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmbgeoorE8r0frAGvY6SFl0xv-sg.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151466&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2ace55926df1c606a4d4af7354aa7011&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151466&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2ace55926df1c606a4d4af7354aa7011&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>Vol.03新手避坑指南：浇水，能有多难！</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoDQUhgSBVjnk9hXJ7WmLIF5SOtx.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151501&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=af568afcb681ca21ad0bd6dc677ba181&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMjExMzQxNg==&amp;mid=2654151501&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=af568afcb681ca21ad0bd6dc677ba181&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>Vol.04新手避坑指南：施肥，是必选项吗</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5Dog3h_g_tdZnLtxsdw4S9I5yz.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
